             And in your place...[K] I will return
            to the past.
        """,
    });
    CallCommon(CORO_MESSAGE_CLOSE_WAIT_FUNC);
    message_SetFace(ACTOR_PLAYER_FUTURE, FACE_PAIN, FACE_POS_TOP_R_CENTER);
    message_Talk({
        english=" Wh-what?!",
    });
    CallCommon(CORO_MESSAGE_CLOSE_WAIT_FUNC);
    Turn2Direction<actor ACTOR_NPC_YONOWAARU_N9>(8, 10, DIR_UPRIGHT);
    WaitExecuteLives(ACTOR_NPC_YONOWAARU_N9);
    message_SetFace(ACTOR_NPC_YONOWAARU, FACE_NORMAL, FACE_POS_STANDARD);
    message_Talk({
        english="""
             If [CS:Y]Grovyle[CR] goes back to
            the past...
        """,
    });
    message_Talk({
        english="""
             [c_name:NPC_HERO_FIRST] and [c_name:NPC_PARTNER_FIRST]
            will be so incredibly happy, don't you agree?
        """,
    });
    message_Talk({
        english="""
             They won't be the slightest bit
            suspicious...[K] They will accept you as
            their friend.
        """,
    });
    message_Talk({
        english="""
             Sadly, the two innocents will be
            unaware of one flaw in their happiness.
        """,
    });
    message_Talk({
        english="""
             The body will be [CS:Y]Grovyle[CR]'s...[K]but
            the consciousness will be--me!
        """,
    });
    CallCommon(CORO_MESSAGE_CLOSE_WAIT_FUNC);
    Turn2Direction<actor ACTOR_NPC_YONOWAARU_N9>(4, 10, DIR_UP);
    WaitExecuteLives(ACTOR_NPC_YONOWAARU_N9);
    message_SetFace(ACTOR_NPC_YONOWAARU, FACE_NORMAL, FACE_POS_STANDARD);
    message_Talk({
        english="""
             Everything we've done has been
            in preparation for this.
        """,
    });
    message_Talk({
        english=" The new agent...[K] In fact--",
    });
    message_Talk({
        english=" [CS:Y]Grovyle[CR]![K] It's you!",
    });
    message_KeyWait();
    SetAnimation<actor ACTOR_NPC_YONOWAARU_N9>(39);
    WaitAnimation<actor ACTOR_NPC_YONOWAARU_N9>();
    message_Talk({
        english=" Uwah ha ha ha ha ha ha!",
    });
    WaitExecuteLives(ACTOR_NPC_YONOWAARU_N9);
    SetAnimation<actor ACTOR_NPC_YONOWAARU_N9>(2);
    CallCommon(CORO_MESSAGE_CLOSE_WAIT_FUNC);
    message_SetFace(ACTOR_PLAYER_FUTURE, FACE_PAIN, FACE_POS_TOP_R_CENTER);
    message_Talk({
        english="""
             No, oh no! [CS:N]Dusknoir[CR]![K]
            This can't be real!
        """,
    });
    message_Talk({
        english=" I mean...[K] When did you plan...",
    });
    message_Talk({
        english="""
             Y-you and I returned together to
            this world from the past.
        """,
    });
    message_Talk({
        english="""
             There wasn't any time when you
            could have told this plan to the [CS:N]Sableye[CR].
        """,
    });
    message_Talk({
        english=" So how did you...",
    });
    CallCommon(CORO_MESSAGE_CLOSE_WAIT_FUNC);
    Wait(30);
    se_Play(8967);
    message_SetFace(ACTOR_PLAYER_FUTURE, FACE_PAIN, FACE_POS_TOP_R_CENTER);
    message_Talk({
        english="""
             ...![K] No, there was time.[K]
            That time...
        """,
    });
    message_Talk({
        english="""
             When we returned to this
            world...[K] And saw the [CS:N]Sableye[CR] the first time.
        """,
    });
    message_Close();
    screen_WhiteOut(1, 30);
    Wait(30);
    end;
}
